+- `github_read_file {repo:"supremeai-core", path:".github/workflows/ci.yml"}`
+- `github_get_failed_logs {runId:"40286008931", repo:"supremeai-core"}`
+- `github_workflow_runs {repo:"supremeai-core", limit:30}`
